<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59195" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κορυθαλία</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορῠθ-θαλλία</span></b> , ἡ, title of Artemis
		at Sparta, Polem Hist. <i><span class="en">
			86
		</span></i>; also in Italy, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυριττοί</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰρεσιώνη</span>
			, Id.:— also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορυθάλεια</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορυθάλη</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορυθαλίς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				303.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				531.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				276.28
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κορυθαλλίστριαι</span></b> ,
				αἱ, girls who dance in honour of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κορυθαλλία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορύθιον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], τό</span>, 
				Dim. of
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρυς</span>,
		<u>Gloss.</u>
        </div>
